        },
        {
          "id": "c-shiji-011-jingdi:m005-0013",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 16,
          "surface": "膠東王",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "cbr-p000941",
          "status": "contextual_provisional"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-shiji-011-jingdi:p006",
      "text": "五年三月，作陽陵、渭橋。五月，募徙陽陵，予錢二十萬。江都大暴風從西方來，壞城十二丈。丁卯，封長公主子蟜為隆慮侯。徙廣川王為趙王。",
      "annotation_status": "named_mentions_first_pass",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-shiji-011-jingdi:m006-0046",
          "start": 46,
