          "start": 57,
          "end": 60,
          "surface": "廣川王",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "cbr-p000944",
          "status": "contextual_provisional"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-shiji-011-jingdi:p007",
      "text": "六年春，封中尉（趙）綰為建陵侯，江都丞相嘉為建平侯，隴西太守渾邪為平曲侯，趙丞相嘉為江陵侯，故將軍布為鄃侯。梁楚二王皆薨。後九月，伐馳道樹，殖蘭池。",
      "annotation_status": "named_mentions_first_pass",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "mentions": [
